WEBVTT

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:02.036
Manual journals start as drafts. Open a new one from the Ledger.

00:00:02.036 --> 00:00:03.088
Pick an account for each line and enter its debit or credit.

00:00:03.088 --> 00:00:03.997
Until debits equal credits, the journal says by how much it is off and cannot be saved.

00:00:03.997 --> 00:00:06.099
Balanced. Create the draft, then submit it for a colleague to approve and post.
